  "gaps": [
    "The 33-credit remaining general education block is derived (45 quarter credits total minus the 12 credits of required MAT1050 and MAT2051). The capture lists MAT1050/MAT2051 under the General Education Requirements heading but does not explicitly state that they count toward the 45.",
    "The 45 general education credits must include a minimum of 4 quarter credits from each category (Communication, Humanities, Natural Science and Mathematics, Social Science). Per-category distribution is not itemized in the ledger.",
    "A minimum of 54 quarter credits from the 3000-level and above is required. The ledger does not determine which elective or general education choices satisfy this.",
    "The capture does not state any residency or institutional-credit requirement (minimum credits that must be completed at Capella), so no requirement is flagged institutionalOnly.",
    "The optional Honors Pathway (PHI-H2005, COM-H4005, SOC-H3005; at least 15 quarter credits applied toward general education) is not included in the base ledger.",
    "The capstone (IT4993) must be taken during the student's final quarter. This is a timing rule, not a residency rule.",
    "The FlexPath option of this program uses program points (22.5 for general education), and the rest of its requirements are cut off in the capture. It is not covered by this ledger."
  ],
